WEBVTT

1
00:00:58.166 --> 00:01:02.500
In verses 13.27 to 13.29,

2
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.750
Lord Krishna briefly explains
the relationship between

3
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:09.458
the body, the soul, and the Paramatma.

4
00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:11.708
Here the body is called the kshetra

5
00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:14.541
and the soul is called the kshetrajna.

6
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.291
He emphasises that every being

7
00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:20.416
should not be seen only in material terms,

8
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:21.500
but the

9
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.625
spiritual element present within

10
00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:25.625
should also be seen.

11
00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:28.000
By adopting such a perspective,

12
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.125
a person develops equanimity,

13
00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:35.208
rises above dualities, and
moves toward liberation.

14
00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:43.250
In verse 13.27,

15
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:44.666
Lord Krishna says

16
00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:47.583
that everything we see in the world

17
00:01:47.583 --> 00:01:49.333
– living or non-living –

18
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:50.208
is the result

19
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:53.458
of the mutual union of body and soul.

20
00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:55.208
This is also called

21
00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:56.875
kshetra-kshetrajna sanyoga.

22
00:01:56.875 --> 00:02:00.375
Just as a house without a resident is lifeless,

23
00:02:00.375 --> 00:02:02.000
in the same way matter

24
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.416
without the soul remains inert.

25
00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:07.000
When the soul and nature come together,

26
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.125
only then do all experiences become possible.

27
00:02:10.125 --> 00:02:15.166
By understanding this fundamental
relationship, you can move

28
00:02:15.166 --> 00:02:17.291
beyond outer appearances and recognise

29
00:02:17.291 --> 00:02:20.875
the spiritual reality hidden
behind every existence.

30
00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:23.958
In verse 13.28,

31
00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:27.083
He makes this vision even clearer –

32
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:28.958
seeing both the soul

33
00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:32.500
and the Paramatma in all bodies.

34
00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.875
The body is perishable

35
00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:36.541
and is destroyed with time,

36
00:02:36.541 --> 00:02:37.708
but the soul

37
00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:41.750
and the Paramatma are eternal
and unchanging.

38
00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.958
The Paramatma is the witness –

39
00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:45.083
silently

40
00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:47.416
observing the soul’s activities

41
00:02:47.416 --> 00:02:50.000
and also guiding it.

42
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:54.000
When we recognise this divine presence in all,

43
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.791
true spiritual knowledge

44
00:02:55.791 --> 00:02:57.458
is attained.

45
00:02:57.458 --> 00:02:59.125
Such a person understands

46
00:02:59.125 --> 00:03:01.041
that the body may be destroyed,

47
00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:03.083
but the spiritual essence within

48
00:03:03.083 --> 00:03:04.750
is never destroyed.

49
00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:05.791
This vision

50
00:03:05.791 --> 00:03:08.791
frees one from fear and attachment,

51
00:03:08.791 --> 00:03:12.708
and brings steadiness and peace within.

52
00:03:12.708 --> 00:03:15.625
In verse 13.29,

53
00:03:15.625 --> 00:03:16.250
Lord Krishna

54
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.458
takes this understanding to the practical level –

55
00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:22.333
when we see the Paramatma equally

56
00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:24.083
in all beings,

57
00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:26.708
our perspective shifts away from criticism

58
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:28.583
and hostility,

59
00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:31.625
toward respect and compassion.

60
00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:34.416
‘Samam pashyan hi sarvatra’ means –

61
00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:36.875
seeing equality everywhere,

62
00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:40.000
recognising the divinity inherent in everyone.

63
00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.500
Such a person does not pollute their mind

64
00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:47.291
with negative thoughts and harmful behaviour.

65
00:03:47.291 --> 00:03:48.500
On the contrary,

66
00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:52.333
by connecting their mind with
this higher understanding,

67
00:03:52.333 --> 00:03:54.166
they move toward the supreme goal –

68
00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:57.291
liberation from the cycle of birth and death.

69
00:03:57.291 --> 00:03:58.208
This teaching

70
00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:00.000
applies especially

71
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.500
to our daily life.

72
00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.875
Often we disturb our mind

73
00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:08.625
through conflict, judgement, and envy.

74
00:04:08.625 --> 00:04:09.416
But when

75
00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:12.458
we consciously remind ourselves

76
00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:14.083
that the eternal presence

77
00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:17.541
of the Paramatma is within everyone,
then with patience

78
00:04:17.541 --> 00:04:21.750
and understanding it becomes easy to respond.

79
00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:25.333
This vision brings harmony to relationships,

80
00:04:25.333 --> 00:04:27.750
reduces negativity,

81
00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:31.166
and elevates our consciousness.

82
00:04:31.166 --> 00:04:32.458
In summary –

83
00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:34.375
Lord Krishna first explains

84
00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:37.041
that everything living and non-living

85
00:04:37.041 --> 00:04:40.708
is only the union of soul and nature.

86
00:04:40.708 --> 00:04:42.416
Then He explains

87
00:04:42.416 --> 00:04:43.916
the importance of recognising

88
00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.916
the Paramatma’s presence in all bodies.

89
00:04:46.916 --> 00:04:49.000
This understanding shows us,

90
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.166
that the soul and the Paramatma are eternal,

91
00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:56.000
and remain unaffected by the
destruction of the body.

92
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.041
Finally He says that one

93
00:04:58.041 --> 00:05:02.250
who maintains this vision becomes
calm, non-violent,

94
00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.500
and steady of mind –

95
00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:08.291
and moves toward liberation.

96
00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:15.541
Sometimes something –

97
00:05:15.541 --> 00:05:19.416
attractive, emotionally touching,

98
00:05:19.416 --> 00:05:23.333
or pleasing to the senses – a person,

99
00:05:23.333 --> 00:05:28.625
an object, or a feeling – captures your attention.

100
00:05:28.625 --> 00:05:30.416
And in that moment

101
00:05:30.416 --> 00:05:33.333
your mind says – ‘I want this…

102
00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:36.666
this will satisfy me.’

103
00:05:36.666 --> 00:05:38.083
But pause!

104
00:05:38.083 --> 00:05:40.958
Everything you see

105
00:05:40.958 --> 00:05:45.583
is the union of matter and soul.

106
00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:48.458
However pleasing any body

107
00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:52.375
or material form may be,

108
00:05:52.375 --> 00:05:57.500
without the soul it is only matter –

109
00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.125
lifeless.

110
00:05:59.125 --> 00:06:01.166
So you,

111
00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:04.875
who are an eternal soul –

112
00:06:04.875 --> 00:06:11.208
will you be captivated by dead matter?

113
00:06:11.208 --> 00:06:13.458
This is the very illusion –

114
00:06:13.458 --> 00:06:17.083
forgetting your true identity

115
00:06:17.083 --> 00:06:20.250
and running after surface attraction.

116
00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.208
The moment you understand

117
00:06:23.208 --> 00:06:26.833
that behind every form there is a soul –

118
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:32.000
and behind every soul there is the Paramatma –

119
00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.416
your vision becomes clear.

120
00:06:34.416 --> 00:06:37.083
Then you end desires

121
00:06:37.083 --> 00:06:39.916
not through forceful suppression,

122
00:06:39.916 --> 00:06:44.041
but through understanding.

123
00:06:44.041 --> 00:06:47.666
You do not reject beauty,

124
00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:48.875
but you

125
00:06:48.875 --> 00:06:52.375
stop worshipping its outer form.

126
00:06:52.375 --> 00:06:56.541
The more you connect to what is real,

127
00:06:56.541 --> 00:07:02.541
the more the attraction of the unreal fades.

128
00:07:02.541 --> 00:07:04.250
This is the path

129
00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.958
to becoming evolved and free.

130
00:07:11.708 --> 00:07:14.208
In families,

131
00:07:14.208 --> 00:07:18.833
misunderstandings often become
the cause of friction.

132
00:07:18.833 --> 00:07:22.041
Sometimes one member feels that another

133
00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:23.375
is obstructing their peace,

134
00:07:23.375 --> 00:07:24.208
comfort,

135
00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:28.166
or sense of security.

136
00:07:28.166 --> 00:07:31.833
Slowly irritability grows,

137
00:07:31.833 --> 00:07:35.416
and as conversation between them decreases,

138
00:07:35.416 --> 00:07:38.541
a wall of silence is formed.

139
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:40.458
The objects, positions,

140
00:07:40.458 --> 00:07:44.375
or expectations you cling to –

141
00:07:44.375 --> 00:07:49.166
all are made of matter, all are temporary.

142
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:54.541
And that which makes all of this alive is the soul.

143
00:07:54.541 --> 00:07:58.125
You are a soul! They too are a soul!

144
00:07:58.125 --> 00:08:02.083
So then what is the conflict about?

145
00:08:02.083 --> 00:08:06.333
Only about material elements or forms!?

146
00:08:06.333 --> 00:08:08.625
When this is understood,

147
00:08:08.625 --> 00:08:13.208
you stop gripping things tightly.

148
00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:16.166
You also stop thinking about
your family members –

149
00:08:16.166 --> 00:08:18.000
‘They are an obstacle

150
00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:21.625
in my path.’

151
00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:23.958
You begin to accept that

152
00:08:23.958 --> 00:08:26.916
they are not merely people who challenge you,

153
00:08:26.916 --> 00:08:31.666
but souls walking on the same path.

154
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:35.833
This vision makes the heart tender.

155
00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:40.083
You choose peace in place of pride.

156
00:08:40.083 --> 00:08:43.958
You adopt understanding in place of accusation.

157
00:08:43.958 --> 00:08:45.458
And from here

158
00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:46.791
the real joy

159
00:08:46.791 --> 00:08:49.750
of family life begins –

160
00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.958
not in having your own way,

161
00:08:52.958 --> 00:08:56.625
but in growing together.

162
00:08:56.625 --> 00:08:59.833
The moment your vision changes,
the atmosphere around you

163
00:08:59.833 --> 00:09:03.000
also begins to change.

164
00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.791
This is not merely knowledge –

165
00:09:05.791 --> 00:09:07.333
this is liberation.

166
00:09:12.083 --> 00:09:13.750
At the workplace

167
00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:18.000
it is easy to get caught in competition –

168
00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.666
sometimes over credit,

169
00:09:19.666 --> 00:09:22.958
sometimes over control and power,
and sometimes

170
00:09:22.958 --> 00:09:28.041
the rivalry of getting ahead in professional life.

171
00:09:28.041 --> 00:09:32.916
Slowly these thoughts also begin to arise –

172
00:09:32.916 --> 00:09:34.000
that a certain person

173
00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.791
is becoming an obstacle in my path,

174
00:09:36.791 --> 00:09:40.000
or that my importance is being reduced.

175
00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.541
This is where conflict begins –

176
00:09:43.541 --> 00:09:46.666
and the mind starts to get entangled –

177
00:09:46.666 --> 00:09:48.416
‘Why them

178
00:09:48.416 --> 00:09:49.916
and not me?’

179
00:09:49.916 --> 00:09:51.625
or

180
00:09:51.625 --> 00:09:56.083
‘They are taking what should have been mine.’

181
00:09:56.083 --> 00:09:58.500
But remember –

182
00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:01.250
everything you are seeing

183
00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:04.916
is the union of matter and soul.

184
00:10:04.916 --> 00:10:08.708
Position, privileges, recognition –

185
00:10:08.708 --> 00:10:12.083
though necessary – are only part
of the material layer.

186
00:10:12.083 --> 00:10:14.708
They are not your real identity.

187
00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:18.000
Nor are they the identity of your colleagues.

188
00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.833
When this inner clarity arrives,

189
00:10:20.833 --> 00:10:22.833
you stop reacting

190
00:10:22.833 --> 00:10:24.250
out of

191
00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.208
insecurity.

192
00:10:26.208 --> 00:10:28.083
You do not evaluate people

193
00:10:28.083 --> 00:10:31.375
only by their outer achievements.

194
00:10:31.375 --> 00:10:34.625
Instead, you begin to see yourself

195
00:10:34.625 --> 00:10:36.125
and others

196
00:10:36.125 --> 00:10:38.458
as souls –

197
00:10:38.458 --> 00:10:41.291
on a shared journey.

198
00:10:41.291 --> 00:10:45.166
This vision changes your way of working,

199
00:10:45.166 --> 00:10:46.833
your style of leadership,

200
00:10:46.833 --> 00:10:51.291
and your approach to resolving conflict.

201
00:10:51.291 --> 00:10:53.416
You work driven

202
00:10:53.416 --> 00:10:55.250
less by a sense of entitlement,

203
00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.458
and more by purpose.

204
00:10:57.458 --> 00:11:00.500
Then, in place of comparison,

205
00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:03.416
you build a culture of contribution.

206
00:11:03.416 --> 00:11:06.541
True clarity at the workplace

207
00:11:06.541 --> 00:11:10.250
comes not from policies, but from perspective –

208
00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:13.750
and when your inner vision changes,

209
00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:18.625
the grip of outer problems loosens on its own.
